# Recipe Finder App 🍳

A full-stack web application for discovering, managing, and saving recipes. Search through your own recipes or explore thousands of recipes from TheMealDB API with intelligent category and ingredient-based search.

![CI/CD Status](https://github.com/Geethika2506/recipe-app/actions/workflows/ci-cd.yml/badge.svg)

---

## ✨ Features

### Core Features
- **Smart Recipe Search**: Search by ingredients (chicken, milk, eggs) or categories (pasta, dessert, seafood)
- **Quick Search Buttons**: One-click search for popular categories and ingredients on the home page
- **External API Integration**: Access 500+ recipes from TheMealDB
- **User Authentication**: Secure JWT-based login and registration with Argon2 password hashing
- **Personal Recipe Management**: Create, edit, and delete your own recipes
- **Favorites System**: Save recipes (both yours and external) for quick access
- **Responsive Design**: Beautiful UI that works on desktop and mobile

### Technical Features
- **Health Monitoring**: `/health` endpoint for application status
- **Prometheus Metrics**: Built-in metrics collection at `/metrics`
- **Docker Support**: Containerized deployment ready
- **CI/CD Pipeline**: Automated testing with GitHub Actions
- **RESTful API**: Well-documented FastAPI backend

