## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.11 or higher
- pip (Python package installer)
- Git
- Docker Desktop (optional, for containerized deployment)

### Option 1: Run Locally (Development)

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Geethika2506/recipe-app.git
cd recipe-app

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate virtual environment
# Windows (Git Bash):
source venv/Scripts/activate
# macOS/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run the application
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# Access at http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

### Option 2: Run with Docker

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Geethika2506/recipe-app.git
cd recipe-app

# Build and run with Docker
docker build -t recipe-app .
docker run -d -p 8000:8000 --name recipe-container recipe-app

# Access at http://localhost:8000
```

### Option 3: Full Stack with Monitoring (Docker Compose)

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Geethika2506/recipe-app.git
cd recipe-app

# Start all services
docker-compose up -d

# IMPORTANT: Fix Argon2 dependency in container
docker-compose exec app pip install argon2-cffi argon2-cffi-bindings
docker-compose restart app
sleep 5

# Access services:
# - App: http://localhost:8000
# - Prometheus: http://localhost:9090
# - Grafana: http://localhost:3000 (admin/admin)
```

