## 🎯 Usage Guide

### Creating an Account
1. Click **"Login"** in the navigation bar
2. Switch to **"Register"** tab
3. Enter username, email, and password (min 6 characters)
4. Click **"Register"**
5. Login with your credentials

### Searching for Recipes

**Method 1: Search Bar**
- Type an ingredient or category
- Click search or press Enter
- See results from both local recipes and external API

**Method 2: Quick Search Buttons (Home Page)**
- Click any **Category button**: Chicken, Beef, Seafood, Pasta, Dessert, Vegetarian, Vegan, Breakfast
- Click any **Ingredient button**: Milk, Cheese, Eggs, Tomato, Potato, Rice, Garlic, Lemon
- Instantly see relevant recipes

**Supported Searches:**
- **Categories**: beef, chicken, dessert, lamb, pasta, pork, seafood, side, starter, vegan, vegetarian, breakfast, goat, miscellaneous, soup, curry, salad
- **Ingredients**: Any ingredient (chicken, milk, cheese, flour, etc.)

### Adding Your Own Recipe
1. Login to your account
2. Navigate to **"My Recipes"**
3. Click **"Add Recipe"** button
4. Fill in the form:
   - Title (required)
   - Description
   - Ingredients (required) - one per line or comma-separated
   - Instructions (required)
   - Prep time, Cook time, Servings
   - Difficulty level
   - Image URL (optional)
5. Click **"Save Recipe"**

### Managing Favorites
- **Add to favorites**: Click the ❤️ heart icon on any recipe card
- **View favorites**: Click **"Favorites"** in navigation
- **Remove**: Click the heart icon again
- Works with both local and external recipes!

### Editing/Deleting Recipes
- Go to **"My Recipes"**
- Click **"Edit"** to modify
- Click **"Delete"** to remove (with confirmation)

