## 🐳 Docker Deployment

### Single Container

```bash
# Build
docker build -t recipe-app .

# Run
docker run -d -p 8000:8000 --name recipe-container recipe-app

# View logs
docker logs -f recipe-container

# Stop
docker stop recipe-container && docker rm recipe-container
```

### Multi-Container with Monitoring

```bash
# Start all services
docker-compose up -d

# FIX: Install Argon2 in running container (IMPORTANT)
docker-compose exec app pip install argon2-cffi argon2-cffi-bindings
docker-compose restart app
sleep 5

# Check status
docker-compose ps

# View logs
docker-compose logs -f app

# Stop all
docker-compose down
```

**Available Services:**

| Service | URL | Credentials |
|---------|-----|-------------|
| Recipe App | http://localhost:8000 | - |
| API Docs | http://localhost:8000/docs | - |
| Health Check | http://localhost:8000/health | - |
| Metrics | http://localhost:8000/metrics | - |
| Prometheus | http://localhost:9090 | - |
| Grafana | http://localhost:3000 | admin/admin |

