## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Port Already in Use
```bash
# Windows
netstat -ano | findstr :8000
taskkill /PID <PID> /F

# Mac/Linux
lsof -ti:8000 | xargs kill -9

# Or use different port
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001
```

### Database Errors
```bash
# Stop server
# Delete database
rm recipes.db

# Restart server (recreates database)
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

### Docker Argon2 Error
```bash
# If you get argon2 import errors in Docker:
docker-compose exec app pip install argon2-cffi argon2-cffi-bindings
docker-compose restart app
```

### Module Not Found
```bash
# Activate virtual environment
source venv/Scripts/activate  # Windows Git Bash
source venv/bin/activate      # Mac/Linux

# Reinstall dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### External API Not Working
- Check internet connection
- Try popular searches: "chicken", "beef", "pasta", "dessert"
- TheMealDB free tier has rate limits

